{{- $groups := groupGlobalErrorsByErrorType}}
{{- $totalCount := $groups.TotalOperationCount}}
{{- $primaryCount := $groups.PrimaryErrorCount}}
{{- $builtInCount := 2}}{{/* HttpRequestException, ResponseValidationError*/}}
{{- $secondaryCount := $groups.LessCommonErrorCount}}
{{- $baseErrorLink := templateErrorMarkdownLink getBaseErrorClassName}}
{{$baseErrorLink}} is the base exception class for all HTTP error responses. It has the following properties:

| Property      | Type                  | Description           |
|---------------|-----------------------|-----------------------|
| `Message`     | *string*              | Error message         |
{{- if eq getResponseFormat "envelope-http" }}
| `Request`     | *HttpRequestMessage*  | HTTP request object   |
| `Response`    | *HttpResponseMessage* | HTTP response object  |
{{- else}}
| `StatusCode`  | *int*                 | HTTP status code      |
| `Headers`     | *HttpResponseHeaders* | HTTP headers          |
| `ContentType` | *string?*             | HTTP content type     |
| `RawResponse` | *HttpResponseMessage* | HTTP response object  |
| `Body`        | *string*              | HTTP response body    |
{{- end}}

{{- if gt (add $primaryCount $secondaryCount) 0 }}

Some exceptions in this SDK include an additional `Payload` field, which will contain deserialized custom error data when present. Possible exceptions are listed in the [Error Classes](#error-classes) section.
{{- end}}

{{templateUsageExample .Local.UsageContext "### Example"}}

### Error Classes

**Primary exception{{if gt $primaryCount 0}}s{{end}}:**
* {{$baseErrorLink}}: The base class for HTTP error responses.
{{- range $groups.PrimaryErrors }}
  * {{templateErrorGroup . $totalCount}}
{{- end }}

<details><summary>Less common exceptions ({{add $builtInCount $secondaryCount}})</summary>
{{""}}
* [`System.Net.Http.HttpRequestException`](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.net.http.httprequestexception): Network connectivity error. For more details about the underlying cause, inspect the `ex.InnerException`.

* Inheriting from {{$baseErrorLink}}:
{{- range $groups.LessCommonErrors}}
  * {{templateErrorGroup . $totalCount}}
{{- end }}
  * {{templateErrorMarkdownLink "ResponseValidationError"}}: Thrown when the response data could not be deserialized into the expected type.
</details>

{{- if $groups.HasErrorsApplicableToNotAllOperations}}

\* Refer to the [relevant documentation](#available-resources-and-operations) to determine whether an exception applies to a specific operation.
{{- end}}
